    "Block Trackers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حظر أدوات التتبع"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Block Trackers"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bloquer les traqueurs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocks Meta Pixel, Facebook and Instagram on other sites, Google Analytics, TikTok and other trackers, so they can't follow you from site to site. Links lose tracking codes such as fbclid, igshid and utm_. The app switcher shows a blank screen instead of the page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يحظر Meta Pixel وفيسبوك وإنستغرام في المواقع الأخرى، وGoogle Analytics وTikTok وأدوات تتبع أخرى، حتى لا تتبعك من موقع إلى آخر. تُحذف من الروابط رموز التتبع مثل fbclid وigshid وutm_. ويُظهر مبدّل التطبيقات شاشة فارغة بدل الصفحة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blocks Meta Pixel, Facebook and Instagram on other sites, Google Analytics, TikTok and other trackers, so they can't follow you from site to site. Links lose tracking codes such as fbclid, igshid and utm_. The app switcher shows a blank screen instead of the page."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bloque Meta Pixel, Facebook et Instagram sur les autres sites, Google Analytics, TikTok et d’autres traqueurs, pour qu’ils ne vous suivent pas de site en site. Les liens perdent les codes de pistage comme fbclid, igshid et utm_. Le sélecteur d’apps affiche un écran vide au lieu de la page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
